  "item_short_desc": "<p>Introduce your little one to the world of aviation with Rothco's Kids Flight Jacket. Crafted from 100% nylon with a water-repellent outer shell, this bomber jacket keeps them dry and comfortable. The poly fiberfill lining provides added warmth, while the reversible rescue orange lining enhances visibility in emergencies. Complete with aviation-inspired patches, including the American flag, F-14, F-117, and fighter pilot patches, this aviator jacket captures the essence of flight.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "1507",
  "description": "<p>Introduce your little one to the world of aviation with Rothco's Kids Flight Jacket. Crafted from 100% nylon with a water-repellent outer shell, this bomber jacket keeps them dry and comfortable. The poly fiberfill lining provides added warmth, while the reversible rescue orange lining enhances visibility in emergencies. Complete with aviation-inspired patches, including the American flag, F-14, F-117, and fighter pilot patches, this aviator jacket captures the essence of flight. Practical features include a zippered utility pocket on the left sleeve with pencil pockets, 2 front slash pockets, and 2 inner slash pockets for additional storage space. The front zipper closure with storm flaps offers protection against the elements, making this flight jacket a must-have for young aviation enthusiasts.</p>",
